{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "fd31266459e733c0afc760647006764e79b2c51a18e0205ec47991e36c7c9cc4", "ja": "ライラ～私の選んだ道～", "zh": "莱拉～我选择的道路～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6109ac0b2ed861f361bbd88f9bcaac66601ca1d709ed2c7106648fa3aef27ef3", "ja": "酔い潰れてしまった莉緒を連れ、劇場に戻っ\nたこのみとプロデューサー。このみは、今の\n自分は自分で選んだ姿、誇りを持っていると\n語る。そんなこのみにプロデューサーは、『\nクラブミリオン』の話を切り出すのだった。", "zh": "带着喝得酩酊大醉的莉绪回到剧场的，是このみ和制作人。这时このみ说，现在的自己是自己选择的样子，对此感到自豪。制作人便对这样的このみ提起了《俱乐部百万》的话题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "079a3ff86ecfd3b1be864e5ecb3a89efcb34efb51e92a3f0855a1785161d46ad", "ja": "（仕事の話を切り出そうとしたら、\nその前に莉緒が酔い潰れてしまった……）", "zh": "（本来想谈工作的，结果莉绪先喝醉倒下了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "8e335177f6cc309e0c203118c163c558469e70e1f22c2cca94d536c8dc09e865", "ja": "う～ん……嵐が来るわ……\nセクシーの嵐が……うう……。", "zh": "嗯……暴风雨要来了……\n性感的暴风雨……呜呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "1ce10bafedf907ab10e627bd09d4e25301e2c272b0ccf087a1b60883759d2e18", "ja": "このままじゃ、お店にも迷惑になっちゃうし。\nどこかで休ませてあげないとよね……。", "zh": "这样下去也会给店里添麻烦的。\n得找个地方让她休息才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0d0106aab2ecfd396ad178356eefa30e25bfa70981de3930da76d8a589a9f7cb", "ja": "ここなら、劇場が近いですね。俺が莉緒を\n支えますから、このみさんは荷物をお願いします。", "zh": "这里离剧场很近。莉绪由我来扶着，木实小姐请帮忙拿行李。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ec79e8831aa25b3233f44ef40ecd1b0362a4e089cb916c16caa6502c9921e218", "ja": "このみさん、莉緒の様子はどうですか？", "zh": "この美小姐，莉绪的情况怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "1adf490faf44645b288af0b635fd9c5ef4c48e8b8eeb0547cf87a0bba0c11182", "ja": "横になったら、だいぶ落ち着いたみたい。\n大丈夫、気分が良くなったら起きてくると思うわ。", "zh": "躺下之后，她好像平静多了。\n没事的，等心情好一些，应该就会起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "5825de07b92b11161c694d9815bcde5d1506f0bbc86323534b1b63b7871740a1", "ja": "莉緒ちゃん、{$P$}がセクシー\nビーストに見惚れてたのが、よっぽど悔しかったのね。", "zh": "莉绪因为看到{$P$}被性感野兽迷住，肯定特别不甘心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "afc08936d87d91a847f7f03c5e77e73285508b1d906f34e6bb80c9616028ebb9", "ja": "あんまり女の子を泣かせちゃダメよ？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "可不能太让女孩子伤心哭泣哦？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "055fb750e52310ff2d5a1da21f118e3798da05883ad3b21e82dd5c4a214d2de1", "ja": "気をつけます……\nそれにしても、嵐みたいな存在でしたね。", "zh": "我会注意的……\n话说回来，她真是像暴风雨一样的存在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "826bc67d36b105774e9f9e39f3f6698b318a38512c3f343dec925bc917415702", "ja": "ええ。正直言うと、私もショックだったわ。だって、\nセクシービーストの眼中に私たちはいなかったし。", "zh": "嗯。老实说，我也很受打击。因为在性感野兽眼里根本没有我们嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "2866e3a3f166caec0a39bab492e69d9574cc7dfbad23a30e72c231f1c9574c09", "ja": "けど、私の分も、莉緒ちゃんが悔しがってくれたから、\nちょっとは冷静でいられたかな……。", "zh": "不过，莉绪也替我感到不甘，所以我才能稍微冷静一点吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8e3bf244b4644c436508aa078c0a02e072b8fbbe42716c90b952ec9a4484f88e", "ja": "このみさん……。", "zh": "木实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "c687de22963a765b4526152b3919b101717945109824d3083949b117dfa75116", "ja": "{$P$}。私ね……昔、沖縄旅行を\nした時に、有名な占い師に見てもらったことがあるの。", "zh": "{$P$}。我啊……以前去冲绳旅行时，曾经请一位有名的占卜师帮我看过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "78d3f36015e967ede8f10a110956569891f3dcd7616af6ae50c536ede0c8f435", "ja": "その人が言うには、私には\nセクシーな美女の守護霊が憑いてるんですって！", "zh": "那个人说，我身上附着着一位性感美女的守护灵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2e52b83dc9612cd610bdfff50c3176110bf0ac59d587ac12b667de18e7e27976", "ja": "えっ……セクシーな美女の、守護霊ですか？", "zh": "诶……性感美女的守护灵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "8ac2dbb00096225fd995d42d644988a89fec1867339f57da18a1c00f123bf45a", "ja": "ええ。そしてその守護霊様は、生前、\nセクシー過ぎて国を滅ぼしてしまったらしいの……。", "zh": "没错。而那位守护灵大人，生前似乎因为过于性感，甚至毁灭了一个国家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1d877fd22453c7437f1bc693c778121f4c7c20778851b2bb3c74e1356c59a9b0", "ja": "つまり、傾国の美女ということですか……\nそれは……。", "zh": "也就是说，是位倾国倾城的美人吗……  \n那还真是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "7041782e457df0c9b880b424f9bf72933088e7cfee27669fc7f98d7d9b68ed59", "ja": "その霊は、自分の美しさで愛する祖国を\n滅ぼしてしまったことを、とても悲しんでいて……。", "zh": "那个幽灵因为自己的美貌毁灭了深爱的祖国，感到非常悲伤……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "de01d1ec7e243b346cbc45eabc6ebcdd1ba98c0267cd24f7d5ec70517a5eb6ca", "ja": "私に同じ思いをさせないために、\n私の成長を止めてしまったんですって。", "zh": "听说，为了不让我也产生同样的感受，她让我的成长停滞不前了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "33a2938458f5f19c664a00b78db762d85d7f76ce0f7ffcca15bde5a4685a57a4", "ja": "驚いちゃうわよね！\nまあ、私も全部を信じてるわけじゃないけど……。", "zh": "会吓一跳吧！\n不过，我也不是全都相信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "aac3bc84ecfaa558d2ed15301765ac463975c3df0f4826f9cb56831275db07e0", "ja": "その時、除霊したら、今からでも身長は取り戻せる\nかもって言われたんだけど……結局、断っちゃった！", "zh": "那时候有人说，只要驱除掉灵，  \n说不定现在还来得及恢复身高……可我最后还是拒绝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4be889cbc2150851e95becc06edde6d1972ec80418da5fb3da59284ead793d9e", "ja": "ど、どうしてですか？　除霊したら、\n更にセクシーになれる可能性があったんですよね？", "zh": "可、可为什么呀？除灵的话，说不定还能变得更性感吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "d61e5f37fa389c9d980835a4aeca90310177c812612411f27a33fe181c38bab9", "ja": "そうね。もっとセクシーになっていたら……\nなんて、考えなかったわけじゃないけど。", "zh": "是啊。如果能变得更性感的话……我也不是没这么想过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "5c4bdd214e6d0f6e2e1f7d8f864fe7e93e4cd65baff0c4bf4e4840a5eff0025e", "ja": "でも、間違った選択をしたとも思ってないわ。\nこれでも今の私、結構気に入っているのよ♪", "zh": "不过，我也不觉得自己做出了错误的选择。\n现在的我，还是挺喜欢的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "8e3bf244b4644c436508aa078c0a02e072b8fbbe42716c90b952ec9a4484f88e", "ja": "このみさん……。", "zh": "木实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "dc3c76d2e8de1a4cb44e32128caa7f4e3038c32df735f06d1a0af6da75582c5b", "ja": "それに、{$P$}がスカウトしたのは、\n今の私……でしょ？", "zh": "而且，{$P$}先生招募的，是现在的我……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "49b3759c479c7b35373b3e26cf25cfc7f2322d4ca25a6026435806022e2ed328", "ja": "理由はなんであれ、\nアイドルになる道を選んだのは私自身……。", "zh": "无论理由是什么，选择成为偶像这条路的，都是我自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "34fced24f7c0c9776b4f3c3bb43c615899265d54c600da9d1874cad323cc14de", "ja": "今の私を好きでいてくれるファンの人達のためにも、\n私は、この私でセクシーを貫くの！　……なんて♪", "zh": "为了喜欢现在的我的粉丝们，我也要坚持做这样的性感自己！……之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "fa7bc81190b07e2ab2e69c4b0e1d6a3e2e56cc620c228f11190de60b15142f48", "ja": "……そうですね。確かに俺がスカウトしたのは、\nそんなこのみさんです。", "zh": "……说得也是呢。当初我发掘的，\n确实就是这样的木实小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "92e04f620f071b949821cca0373d5a40f2fff60e060c9ded42497f9a5bd22fb2", "ja": "そんな、ほれぼれするほど魅力的なこのみさんです！\nこれからも、一緒に頑張りましょう！", "zh": "就是这样一位魅力十足、让人心驰神往的木实小姐！\n今后也一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_05_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "69523956437f8efae3a6adc476020ee8a73442e33a1e54b90f233506bd7bac63", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}♪\nでもね、成長するのを諦めたわけじゃないのよ？", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}♪\n不过呢，我可没有放弃成长哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
